{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い日が続いてます。\n倒れないように頑張ってるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からめっちゃはしゃいだよー\n楽しいー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日からすごーい充実してるの。\nただ暑いの苦手だー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/07/5401187/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日焼け止めも念入りに塗らないと\nほんとにすぐ焼けるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日かなりんの誕生日会しました！\nかなりんおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/07/5401187/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもかまちょしてね。\nまりちゃぺろぺろって言ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼みにゃみ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/07/5401187/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はメイク自分でしましたどや。\nアイラインが難しいのはね、\n自分のまつげが\n変に生えてるからだと思うんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/07/5401187/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では引き続き頑張るよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/07/5401187/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}